      "content": "It's definitely concerning if a product you're using collects more data than necessary. Smart-shoes can indeed collect detailed information, but there is no verified proof that [Brand Name] is using it covertly or building psych profiles. It might be worth investigating further or reaching out to [Brand Name] directly for clarification on their data practices. It’s also a good idea to review the privacy policy of their app and consider disabling data sharing options if you don't feel comfortable. Keep an eye out for any official statements from the company addressing these concerns.",
